==Battleground==
*10 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 1.67~2 seconds<sup>50f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use at least 2 meatshields ([[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cat]]...) and have several [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating cats]] such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]], [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to defeat the Mooths and J.K. Bun Bun.

Alternatively, you can use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] to kill J.K. Bun Bun faster. Some examples are [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]]. Having [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]], or basically any other long-ranged cats (e.g. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] etc.) can also help.

